sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Gate as Completion Gate
  participant Evid as Evidence Graph
  participant Verdict as Verdict Service
  participant KB as Knowledge Writer
  participant Arch as Archive
  participant DB as State Store
  participant EV as Event Log
  Gate->>Evid: evaluate C1-C5 + C7
  Evid-->>Gate: binary evidence refs
  Gate->>Verdict: recompute independent verdict
  Verdict-->>Gate: verdict + divergence
  alt 任一证据门禁失败
    Gate-->>DB: keep non-terminal / BLOCKED_HUMAN
    Gate->>EV: completion.blocked
  else C1-C5 + C7 满足
    Gate->>KB: write_playbook + failure candidates
    KB-->>Gate: C6 evidence / no_reusable_knowledge
    Gate->>Arch: archive artifacts + manifest
    Arch-->>Gate: archive receipt
    Gate->>Gate: sign completion report
    Gate->>DB: write terminal + report hash
    Gate->>EV: task.completed exactly once
  end
  Note over Gate,DB: C6 在归档前补齐；终态没有合格报告则数据库拒绝写入
